      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROYAL GHOST (2) started at long odds last time but ran well above expectations, breaking through for a maiden win by 1.3 lengths at Sale over 510m (29.37). Nicely drawn here. Looks the one to beat. WEDGETAIL (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Q Lakeside behind Purpose (25.69) in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expecting another good run. SCARCITY (5) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (30.14) at this track in a Grade 6 over 520m. Overdue and expected to feature again. HARA'S MOSAIC (7) comes off a (20.37) win last time, scoring by 1.5 lengths in a Maiden over 366m at Capalaba. Has already won out of this draw.",
